  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 200°C and butter a 23x33cm baking dish.",
    "Toss sliced potatoes with olive oil, minced garlic, ground cardamom, and a pinch of salt until evenly coated.",
    "Layer the potato slices in the dish, overlapping slightly.",
    "Pour vegetable stock over the potatoes, then drizzle apricot jam evenly across the top.",
    "Sprinkle grated Gruyere and Parmesan cheeses over the jam.",
    "Cover with foil and bake for 35 minutes, then remove the foil.",
    "Broil on high for 5 minutes until the top is golden and bubbly.",
    "Garnish with chopped chives before serving."
  ],
